        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tosbik Around the World is a handdrawn 2D Arcade game where you play as a sea turtle named Tosbik and you want to clean the seas from the strange stuff people threw into it! You shoot starfish to cans, plastic duckies, beach balls and more! You turn them into magical starfish and make the sea cleaner!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807000/extras/2cce1c79c1129fe7dd225648b82a27f4.poster.avif?t=1765904095\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807000/extras/2cce1c79c1129fe7dd225648b82a27f4.webm?t=1765904095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807000/extras/2cce1c79c1129fe7dd225648b82a27f4.mp4?t=1765904095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you shoot a seaweed, then you are in for a treat!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807000/extras/e31fa8d9f79abf8f574c83e9d0a63f88.poster.avif?t=1765904095\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807000/extras/e31fa8d9f79abf8f574c83e9d0a63f88.webm?t=1765904095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807000/extras/e31fa8d9f79abf8f574c83e9d0a63f88.mp4?t=1765904095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Or just have a chill time in a beautiful sunset...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807000/extras/82f26d093b57b441df7b3bfe696193b2.poster.avif?t=1765904095\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807000/extras/82f26d093b57b441df7b3bfe696193b2.webm?t=1765904095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807000/extras/82f26d093b57b441df7b3bfe696193b2.mp4?t=1765904095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you are in need, you can call in your friends for help!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807000/extras/36134247cd4bca7c929e2eccfd22d4e9.poster.avif?t=1765904095\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807000/extras/36134247cd4bca7c929e2eccfd22d4e9.webm?t=1765904095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807000/extras/36134247cd4bca7c929e2eccfd22d4e9.mp4?t=1765904095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tosbik Around the World is a handdrawn 2D Arcade game where you play as a sea turtle named Tosbik and you want to clean the seas from the strange stuff people threw into it! You shoot starfish to cans, plastic duckies, beach balls and more! You turn them into magical starfish and make the sea cleaner!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807000/extras/2cce1c79c1129fe7dd225648b82a27f4.poster.avif?t=1765904095\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807000/extras/2cce1c79c1129fe7dd225648b82a27f4.webm?t=1765904095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807000/extras/2cce1c79c1129fe7dd225648b82a27f4.mp4?t=1765904095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you shoot a seaweed, then you are in for a treat!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807000/extras/e31fa8d9f79abf8f574c83e9d0a63f88.poster.avif?t=1765904095\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807000/extras/e31fa8d9f79abf8f574c83e9d0a63f88.webm?t=1765904095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807000/extras/e31fa8d9f79abf8f574c83e9d0a63f88.mp4?t=1765904095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Or just have a chill time in a beautiful sunset...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807000/extras/82f26d093b57b441df7b3bfe696193b2.poster.avif?t=1765904095\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807000/extras/82f26d093b57b441df7b3bfe696193b2.webm?t=1765904095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807000/extras/82f26d093b57b441df7b3bfe696193b2.mp4?t=1765904095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you are in need, you can call in your friends for help!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807000/extras/36134247cd4bca7c929e2eccfd22d4e9.poster.avif?t=1765904095\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807000/extras/36134247cd4bca7c929e2eccfd22d4e9.webm?t=1765904095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807000/extras/36134247cd4bca7c929e2eccfd22d4e9.mp4?t=1765904095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
